  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preservation of Archaeological Collections at the Livingstone Museum</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Home to five major collections, the Livingstone Museum is Zambias oldest and largest national museum. This project, which involves archaeological collections storage upgrades and preventive conservation training for museum staff, directly supports the U.S. embassys efforts to promote tourism and sustainable economic development in partnership with the museum.</narrative>
  </description>
